ing in its path, or ride the winds of Fujin to slice through any yakuza that stand in your way. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SSStylish Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain together kills to earn S, SS and P ranks in each level and earn Schmunny to buy new levels, or try your hand at Gauntlet Mode to earn Bones for some decorations in the Hub.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plenty of ways to Slice and Dice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is hand-crafted with a different mechanic or idea in mind, be it slicing through as fast as you can with an array of well timed abilities, or kicking molotovs into your enemies' faces. See if you can master them all for the illustrious P-Rank!</p>","developers":["Juicy Pulp Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162850/header.jpg?t=1739915752","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257092956,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092956/movie480.mp4?t=1738094711","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092956/movie_max.mp4?t=1738094711"},"name":"Trailer Final","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257092956/9c212f02c6c1851de1339044592706424d7daba8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738094711","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092956/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738094711","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092956/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738094711"}}],"name":"Lightning Katana","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_